    "id": "h014-026",
    "en": "A task is here once the work landed, such as a merged PR, or once its result reached whoever needs it and nobody is still expected to reply, decide, or act."
  },
  {
    "id": "h014-027",
    "en": "A task is here once the work was dropped on purpose or is no longer needed."
  },
  {
    "id": "h014-028",
    "en": "A task is here while a worker is assigned to the work, even while that work waits on its own checks such as CI."
  },
  {
    "id": "h014-029",
    "en": "A task is here while no worker is assigned and the work is still needed, whether it hasn't started, was paused, or waits on someone before it can start."
  },
  {
    "id": "h014-030",
    "en": "A task is here while started work waits on someone to review or act, such as reviewing or merging a PR, approving a plan they were asked to approve, making a decision, or doing something only they can do."
  },
